155:## Available Imports
161:| `typebox`, `typebox/compile`, `typebox/value` | Schema definitions for tool parameters |
162:| `@earendil-works/pi-ai` | AI utilities (`StringEnum` for string enums, transcript helpers, model types). Inside Pi it also exports TypeBox's `Type`, `Static` and `TSchema`, which the published package no longer re-exports; import them from `typebox` in new code |
